  "description": "Indulge your designs with the sweet, substantial presence of Dango, a chunky sans serif typeface that packs a playful punch. This ultra-bold display font features heavy, rounded letterforms inspired by the soft, chewy aesthetic of traditional Japanese dumplings. With its minimal negative space and “maximum-impact” weight, Dango is the premier choice for vibrant snack packaging, independent streetwear branding, modern toy store logos, and high-energy “pop-art” social media headers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Indulge your designs with the sweet, substantial presence of Dango, a chunky sans serif typeface that packs a playful punch. This ultra-bold display font features heavy, rounded letterforms inspired by the soft, chewy aesthetic of traditional Japanese dumplings. With its minimal negative space and “maximum-impact” weight, Dango is the premier choice for vibrant snack packaging, independent streetwear branding, modern toy store logos, and high-energy “pop-art” social media headers.</p>",
